comments.text:
Just sayin' I note that some people are complaining about the AI models demonstrating strong social biases, particularly towards Woke. The emergent behaviors with a homicidal Alice or shop lifting Bob are very similar to the emergent behaviors Woke has (cough) awoken in San Francisco, Los Angeles, and other places. I really hope somebody can grit his teeth, risk the spurious copyright issues, and train the AI with everything on which digital copies can be found and then let the AI churn to figure out which "alignments" provide the best outcomes for the most people. "Yeah, AI, we humans are a hodge podge mess of conflicting ideas and somehow over time manage to work it out. Can you help smooth out some of the current lumpiness?"

People being people, I give this a probability zero of happening except by accident.

{o.o}
